## Interface: 11509, 16001, 20506, 120100
# 11509 = Era 1.15.9,          16001 = WoW Forever beta 1.60.1
# 20506 = TBC Anniversary 2.5.6, 120100 = retail 12.1.0
#
# All four are the client build strings from Battle.net .build.info run
# through the standard major*10000 + minor*100 + patch encoding. Era and
# Anniversary are known-good and confirm the formula; retail and Forever
# are derived the same way. Drop a number here and that client reports the
# addon as Incompatible rather than merely out of date, so keep all four
# even while only some are being tested. Confirm Forever with /rccompat
# once the beta is joinable.
## Title: Rustcore
## Notes: Disabled repair and deletes items on death.
## Author: Rustcore
## Version: 1.3.1
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\Rustcore\RCicon.png
## SavedVariables: RustcoreDB

# Client abstraction. Must load first - everything else asks it. Both
# backends ship and both load; RustcoreCompat picks one at runtime rather
# than at packaging time, because WoW Forever's TOC flavor suffix is not
# published and it may well fall back to this file rather than a
# flavor-specific one.
